wikiscroll-zh is a modified copy of WikiScroll. Modifications: the interface and
Chinese article text are served in Traditional Chinese (MediaWiki variant
conversion, not translation), and deployment values (site origin, card library,
contact address) are read from configuration instead of being hard-coded.
